{"version":1,"content":"<p>黃仁勳認了。11 月 8 日，英偉達公開了他寫給全體員工的一封信。63 歲的老黃在信裏承認對妻子不忠，還寫了一句「我欠我的家人和你們所有人一個道歉」。隨即英偉達董事會當天宣佈啓動獨立調查。信裏沒寫名字，但大家都知道説的是 Alice Huang，新加坡公司 Megaspeed 的前高管。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585762.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.111208+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:49:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"8e885f912d266becdebfbdd5ff6c608d62d225963c2d2775d81d1b5c508f817e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}